§ `ss 6C, 6D, 6EA, 7B(3) -- is the holder bound`

-- d044: Jarrah in its first year is a small business operator; d052: once above $3 million, never again (s 6D(4)(a)).
#ASSERT `Is the holder a small business operator` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)`
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the holder a small business operator` `Jarrah in April 2036, previous year turnover assumed 3400000 (d052)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the holder a small business operator` `Jarrah later, turnover back at 2500000`)
#ASSERT `Is the holder a small business operator` `a shop with turnover of exactly 3000000 last year`

#ASSERT NOT (`Is the holder bound by the APPs` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)`)
#ASSERT `Is the holder bound by the APPs` `Jarrah in 2031 having registered a choice under s 6EA (d044)`
#ASSERT `Is the holder bound by the APPs` `Jarrah in April 2036, previous year turnover assumed 3400000 (d052)`
#ASSERT `Is the holder bound by the APPs` `a Commonwealth agency`

-- d044 / d052: Jarrah's employees. Even once Jarrah is bound, the employee records exemption takes their records out.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do the APPs protect my employee record` `Jarrah in April 2036, previous year turnover assumed 3400000 (d052)` TRUE)
#ASSERT `Do the APPs protect my employee record` `Jarrah in April 2036, previous year turnover assumed 3400000 (d052)` FALSE

§ `APP 12 -- access`

-- c043: Chloe asks the card issuer for what it holds about her.
#ASSERT `Must the holder give me access` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Must the holder give me access` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)` FALSE)

#ASSERT (`By when must the holder respond to my request` `a Commonwealth agency`) EQUALS `within 30 days after the request`
#ASSERT (`By when must the holder respond to my request` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)`) EQUALS `within a reasonable period after the request`
#ASSERT (`By when must the holder respond to my request` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)`) EQUALS `no deadline, because the holder is not bound by the APPs`

#ASSERT (`What may I be charged for access` `a Commonwealth agency`) EQUALS `nothing`
#ASSERT (`What may I be charged for access` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)`) EQUALS `a charge for giving access that is not excessive, and nothing for making the request`

#ASSERT `Must I get a written notice of the refusal` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)` TRUE FALSE

§ `APP 13 -- correction`

#ASSERT `Must the holder correct my information` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Must the holder correct my information` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)` TRUE TRUE TRUE)

#ASSERT `Must the holder attach my statement` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `Is a correction free under APP 13` `the card issuer, a bank (c043, k048)`

§ `APP 7 -- direct marketing (c044)`

#ASSERT (`May the business market to me` `a national retailer (c044)` `a telemarketing call to Chloe, the Do Not Call Register Act applying (c044)`) EQUALS `APP 7 does not reach it, because the Do Not Call Register Act or the Spam Act applies`
#ASSERT (`May the business market to me` `a national retailer (c044)` `a catalogue by post after Chloe asked the retailer to stop (c044)`) EQUALS `APP 7 forbids it`
#ASSERT (`May the business market to me` `a national retailer (c044)` `the same catalogue before she asked (c044)`) EQUALS `APP 7 allows it`
#ASSERT (`May the business market to me` `a national retailer (c044)` `a mailing from a bought list, no consent, consent practicable`) EQUALS `APP 7 forbids it`
#ASSERT (`May the business market to me` `Jarrah on 1 June 2031, first year, turnover assumed 400000 (d044)` `the same catalogue before she asked (c044)`) EQUALS `APP 7 does not reach it, because the marketer is not bound by the APPs`

#ASSERT `Must the business stop when I ask` `a national retailer (c044)` `a catalogue by post after Chloe asked the retailer to stop (c044)`

§ `ss 6N, 21C, 21P -- the credit file and the lender (c043, k048)`

#ASSERT NOT (`Is it credit information` `information about income or savings`)

-- c043: the card issuer will tell the bureau of Chloe's application, so it must name the bureau.
#ASSERT `Must the lender name the credit reporting body` TRUE

-- k048: had one of Jake's cards been refused on his credit report, he must be told and the bureau named.
#ASSERT `Must the lender give me a refusal notice naming the bureau` TRUE TRUE TRUE

